{"id":"9b1c0f899cda3156","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Zeta Number","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Zeta Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Zeta Number","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Zeta Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2206a687b3a6dd80\" href=\"?note=2206a687b3a6dd80\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (ordinal parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S\\)</span> (canonical fixed-point predicate for the epsilon enumeration)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A zeta number is a fixed point of the epsilon-number enumeration; the canonical predicate defines that enumeration extensionally by order type.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number","status":"resolved","id":"2206a687b3a6dd80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ZetaNumber}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\alpha)","display":true}],"bytes":883,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3023","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-zeta-number]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["2206a687b3a6dd80"]}